# A map as a diagram: the elements on a canvas, their branches and associations.

diagram-map = 导图
diagram-idea = 名称
diagram-show-all = 显示整个导图
diagram-tidy = 整理整个导图
# The keys are shown as keys, where the variables stand.
diagram-hint-linking = 单击要关联的元素，或用方向键移到它上面再按 { $enter } · 按 { $esc } 放弃
diagram-show-under = 显示其下的内容
diagram-hide-under = 隐藏其下的内容
diagram-link-handle = 拖到另一个元素上以关联两者

## The view

diagram-view = 视图
diagram-zoom-out = 缩小
diagram-zoom-in = 放大
diagram-actual-size = 实际大小
# How large the map is shown, in hundredths of its size.
diagram-zoom = { $percent }%

## Copying and pasting elements.

diagram-copied = { $count ->
   *[other] 已复制 { $count } 个元素及其下的全部内容
}
diagram-nothing-copied = 还没有复制任何内容
diagram-pasted-elsewhere = 复制的内容来自另一个项目，不能粘贴到这里
